er week no appointment necessary self select items from the shelves produce area freezer and cooler within the shopping area offers home delivery to zip codes in west seattle also offers pet food and commodities 3419 southwest morgan street seattle king 98126 food pantry and commodities commodity supplemental food program food pantries grocery ordering delivery pet food', 'westseattlefoodbank.org', 0, 0, 'west-seattle-food-bank-food-pantry-and-commodities-seattle-40c59e46');
